s="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div>Keys: how many keys and fobs you hand over. Use <b class="gd-ui">+</b> and <b class="gd-ui">−</b>.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-28-handover-08-keys-phone-13bec781.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div>Photo set: 19 photos in order. Press <b class="gd-ui">Take this photo</b> for the next one; every photo is also in the list below, with <b class="gd-ui">Retake</b> if needed.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-29-handover-09-photos-phone-767ecd4f.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div>Damage: tap the car diagram where it is, choose Where and Type, then <b class="gd-ui">Add the damage</b>.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-30-handover-10-damage-phone-a43b142f.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div>Tracker: it should say in place and reporting. <b class="gd-ui">Check again</b> if not. The car has to go anyway? Open <b class="gd-ui">The car has to go anyway?</b>, say why and press <b class="gd-ui">Release without the tracker</b>: an Admin is told at once.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-31-handover-11-tracker-phone-817976ce.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">11</span><div>Renter reviews: the renter reads the summary of odometer, fuel, keys, photos and damage.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-32-handover-12-summary-phone-b1787a2d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div><div class="gd-pcell"><div class="gd-pcap"><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">12</span><div>Signatures: the renter signs, then you. <b class="gd-ui">Use this signature</b> for each.</div></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/350"><img src="/guides/img/field-33-handover-13-signatures-phone-fac8ea8d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="350"></div></div></figure></div></div><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol" start="13"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">13</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Hand over the keys</b>. You see &quot;Checked out. The rental has started.&quot; The renter gets the photo report by email and in their Documents.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Photos wait on the phone without a connection and upload by themselves when it returns; the count shows what is still uploading. Each photo keeps its time, and the place when your phone allows location. No signal on a step? It says &quot;Answers kept on this phone&quot; and you can go on: press Try again, or they are sent when the signal returns.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-sign-now-on-this-device" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Sign now on this device</h2><p class="gd-p">The renter (or an additional driver) has not signed the rental agreement yet? They sign on your phone.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">On the job, press <b class="gd-ui">Sign now on this device</b>. It shows who still has to sign and whether their licence is on file.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the person: the name matches their licence, and you saw the original licence. Tick both. No licence on file? Press <b class="gd-ui">Photograph: Licence, front</b> (and the back and the selfie).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Hand the device to</b> and their name. They read the agreements (CarmaCars&#39; and Blind Spot&#39;s), tick the statements and sign with their name or their finger.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">They hand the phone back: press <b class="gd-ui">Back to the staff view</b>. The signature record says it was signed in person, collected by you, on your phone.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-the-agreements-at-check-out" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The agreements at check-out</h2><p class="gd-p">Both rental agreements follow the check-out.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Signing at pickup? Record the odometer and the fuel on the check-out first, then hand over the device: the agreement then shows the time, kilometres and fuel out, and the signed copy holds them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">The signer gets a code on their phone, initials the key terms, ticks the consents and draws their signature.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Already signed online? When you complete the check-out, the &quot;as picked up&quot; copy of both agreements is made with your readings and your countersignature, and emailed to the renter.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">The check-out stops if the agreement is missing something a claim needs (a licence expiry, a VIN). Ask the office to fill it on the booking, or an Admin to override.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-the-deposit-on-your-phone" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The deposit on your phone</h2><p class="gd-p">Deposit not taken yet? The ready check shows how to take it under the Deposit line. You never type a card number.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Card hold: hand this phone to the renter</b>. They type their credit card in Stripe&#39;s secure form and press the button with the amount.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">They see &quot;Hold placed&quot;: take the phone back and press <b class="gd-ui">Back to the job</b>. The ready check shows the deposit taken.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">A rental longer than the hold limit shows <b class="gd-ui">Save the card on this phone (long rental)</b> instead: Finance charges the deposit to that card.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">No credit card? When CarmaCars allows it, the renter pays the deposit by e-Transfer or in cash: record it under the Deposit line.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="a-handover-add-ons-to-put-in-the-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Add-ons to put in the car</h2><p class="gd-p">A booking may come with add-ons: a baby seat, a child or booster seat, flowers, an umbrella, a phone charger or a prepaid full tank.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the job. Under Put in the car you see each add-on, how many, and what to do (for example &quot;Put the bouquet on the front passenger seat&quot;).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Put every item in the car before the handover. The Car ready step lists them again.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Prepaid fuel: the renter may return the car at any fuel level. Do not charge for fuel at the return.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A chauffeur on the booking: Fleet tells you who drives and when.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>An item missing? Write it in the note for Fleet on the Car ready step and call the office before the handover.</div></aside><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The photo count shows &quot;19 of 19 photos taken · all uploaded&quot; when the set is complete. The first photo must show the plate. Open circles on the damage diagram were recorded before; add only what is new.</div></aside></section>');
-- GUIDES 0322 END
